    "body": "Dispositioned review 5545891883 at 8b8dfbe9c9544bc4de98e338096273d11e3c885a: 2 fixed, 0 resolved as false positives, 1 deferred.\n- High 1, exact catalog charged audio and image cache reads at the text cache-read rate and accepted cache details above the aggregate: fixed in 8b8dfbe9. Only text cache tokens are billed at the cache read price, and contradictory details fail with `cache modality details exceed aggregate cache tokens`. Covered by `TestCalculateResolvedCost_ExactCatalogCacheReadPriceAppliesToTextCacheTokensOnly`, which fails against the previous calculation.\n- Medium 1, exact catalog did not report a partially priced cache-creation breakdown: fixed in 8b8dfbe9. `exactCatalogUnpricedCacheCreation` follows the same price fallback as `exactCatalogCacheCreationCost` and reports `cache_creation_5m` or `cache_creation_1h` when that part has neither its own price nor the generic one. Covered by `TestCalculateResolvedCost_ExactCatalogPartiallyPricedCacheCreationBreakdown`.\n- High 2, the DeepSeek production cache read prices are unset: deferred to TXE-4531 R4. It is a production data write, not a code change. The SQL for rows 147–150 is prepared and handed to the repository owner to run; the PR body's Open items lists each value and its source.\n\n<!-- fix-pr disposed review=5545891883 rev=571f27ef7e44 head=8b8dfbe9c9544bc4de98e338096273d11e3c885a -->\n",
