    "body": "Dispositioned review 5546039867 at 04c715dd829e87adcab6a430dbfb4e647408eeb1: 1 fixed, 0 resolved as false positives, 0 deferred.\n- Medium 1, the exact catalog warning left out image output billed at 0: fixed in 04c715dd. When image output has neither its own price nor an effective output price, `image_output` is listed. Covered by `TestCalculateResolvedCost_ExactCatalogReportsUnpricedImageOutput`, which checks image-only usage (`image_output`), mixed usage (`output`, `image_output`), and the fallback to the output price (no warning); it fails when the check is removed.\n\n<!-- fix-pr disposed review=5546039867 rev=e44854f40c60 head=04c715dd829e87adcab6a430dbfb4e647408eeb1 -->\n",
