    "body": "Dispositioned review 5550338861 at 17299111c10bb4db65f42755d2dac242bc1c9850: 1 fixed, 0 resolved as false positives, 0 deferred.\n- P2, first-call reconciliation priced aggregate modality tokens after the exact catalog path stopped rejecting them: fixed in 17299111.\n  - The finding holds. `usage_logs.input_tokens` and `output_tokens` are totals that include audio and image tokens, and `firstCallUsageTokens` passes them together with the modality fields.\n  - Before this PR, the exact catalog path rejected the modalities, so the reconciler recorded `official_price_unavailable`.\n  - Billing now charges unpriced modalities at 0, so the reconciler itself marks any usage with audio input, image input, audio output, or audio or image cache reads as `official_price_unavailable`. A comparison price that counts audio at the text rate, or leaves it out, is not an official price.\n  - Covered by two new cases in `TestFirstCallPricingReconciler_MarksUncomparableFactsUnavailable` (realtime audio, image input). Both fail when the check is removed.\n\n<!-- fix-pr disposed review=5550338861 rev=7bc8831f935c head=17299111c10bb4db65f42755d2dac242bc1c9850 -->\n",
