    "body": "Dispositioned review 5550655422 at 2bf1311d2bb87741c536af0694229f85e885be44: 1 fixed, 0 resolved as false positives, 0 deferred.\n- P2, first-call reconciliation accepted web search usage without a per-call price: fixed in 2bf1311d.\n  - The reconciler passes no `WebSearchPricePerCall`, and the exact catalog path now bills an unpriced web search at 0. The comparison price would therefore leave the search charge out.\n  - Usage with web search calls is now `official_price_unavailable`, as it was before this PR.\n  - Covered by the `web search without a per-call price` case in `TestFirstCallPricingReconciler_MarksUncomparableFactsUnavailable`, which fails when the check is removed.\n\n<!-- fix-pr disposed review=5550655422 rev=1599b7d3741b head=2bf1311d2bb87741c536af0694229f85e885be44 -->\n",
