    "body": "Dispositioned review 5550906105 at c6f314a3806a7acbadf6b906b2b95c7afbcff82d: 2 fixed, 0 resolved as false positives, 0 deferred.\n- P2, the first-call reconciler rejected modalities for image and per-request variants: fixed in c6f314a3.\n  - The unavailable check now applies only to token-priced catalog variants.\n  - Image and per-request official prices depend on the request count alone.\n  - Covered by `TestFirstCallPricingReconciler_ImagePricedVariantIgnoresImageInputModality`: an image-priced variant with image input gets an official price of 2 × $0.04. The test fails without the mode condition.\n- P2, audio-only realtime output was billed as text: fixed in c6f314a3.\n  - `validateOpenAIRealtimeUsage` requires the output details to sum to `output_tokens`, so when output details are present, text output comes from the text detail only, and a missing text detail means zero.\n  - Previously the aggregate was billed as text. With an audio price configured, audio was charged twice (that part predates this PR). Without one, this PR would have charged audio at the text rate.\n  - Covered by `TestOpenAIGatewayServiceRecordUsage_RealtimeAudioOnlyOutputIsNotBilledAsText`, with and without an audio price. It fails against the previous normalization.\n\n<!-- fix-pr disposed review=5550906105 rev=03691f67d0b4 head=c6f314a3806a7acbadf6b906b2b95c7afbcff82d -->\n",
